      "text": "Part | Current working structure (2026\nNational Paper I) | What you must be able to do\nListening | 20 items / 30 marks | Catch key facts, changes, attitude, intention,\ninference and paraphrase.\nReading | 15 MCQs + 5 gap-filling / 50 marks | Locate evidence, recognise paraphrase, infer\ncarefully, follow text logic.\nLanguage\nUse | 15 cloze + 10 grammar filling / 30 marks | Use vocabulary and grammar inside context, not as\nisolated rules.\nWriting | Practical writing + continuation / 40\nmarks | Cover task points, organise clearly, connect story\nlogic, write accurately.",
